    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> What is the story of this game? </strong></h2><br>This is a fictional story in which you play as a KunKun enthusiast named Su Shan, who sneaks into the suspected KunKun residence to explore.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> What is the gameplay of this game? </strong></h2><br>It's a first-person horror game with elements of both horror and comedy. In the game, you need to secretly explore KunKun's residence.<br><br>The game includes chase battles and a variety of puzzles.<br><br>The game contains some hidden exploration elements, some of which affect the ending.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> How many endings are there in this game? </strong></h2><br>This game contains 2 endings, which are triggered by meeting certain conditions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The screenshot of the game is as follows\uff1a</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850300/extras/276f42bdfe88b39e0bfa6271c9885959.avif?t=1753105414\" width=624 height=388 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850300/extras/ff54bc01efb1d3164111f1d4b014e35c.avif?t=1753105414\" width=624 height=388 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850300/extras/7539af1107f1235339065a85b0b51e67.avif?t=1753105414\" width=624 height=388 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850300/extras/535037dea2ab3fb47f702b7c4aca7d6b.avif?t=1753105414\" width=624 height=388 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850300/extras/c634ca70f37c142da22a26891becdb81.avif?t=1753105414\" width=624 height=388 /></span><br><br>All content in the game is unrelated to reality, and any similarity is purely coincidental.<br>The game contains scare elements. If you lack courage, please exit in a timely manner.",
